  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 2.16,
      "end": 4.14,
      "en": "Hello everyone, welcome back to EnglishPod.",
      "zh": "大家好，欢迎回到 EnglishPod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 4.76,
      "end": 5.22,
      "en": "My name is Marco.",
      "zh": "我叫 Marco。"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 5.84,
      "end": 6.84,
      "en": "And I'm Erika.",
      "zh": "我叫 Erika。"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 6.84,
      "end": 8.26,
      "en": "And today we're at a wedding ceremony.",
      "zh": "而今天我们要参加婚礼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 8.92,
      "end": 9.86,
      "en": "Alright, nice!",
      "zh": "不错，不错！"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 10.68,
      "end": 11.68,
      "en": "Another nice wedding.",
      "zh": "另一个美好的婚礼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 11.68,
      "end": 12.68,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 12.68,
      "end": 17.68,
      "en": "But of course, it wouldn't be EnglishPod unless we have something unexpected happening at this wedding.",
      "zh": "但当然，除非我们在这场婚礼上发生了意想不到的事情，否则它不会是 Englishpod。"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 17.68,
      "end": 19.0,
      "en": "Okay, so we're going to be talking about hands.",
      "zh": "好吧，我们将谈论手。"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 20.2,
      "end": 22.78,
      "en": "But Marco, what is there to say about a hand?",
      "zh": "但是马可，对一只手有什么好说的？"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 23.6,
      "end": 28.08,
      "en": "Well, as you may or may not know, each finger has a name on your hand.",
      "zh": "好吧，您可能知道也可能不知道，每个手指的手上都有一个名字。"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 28.49,
      "end": 28.83,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 30.09,
      "end": 32.53,
      "en": "So we're going to learn what those names are in English.",
      "zh": "所以我们要学习这些名字是什么名字。"
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 32.93,
      "end": 33.17,
      "en": "Perfect.",
      "zh": "太好了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 33.75,
      "end": 38.93,
      "en": "And also, we're going to learn about some common phrases that you might hear in an English wedding.",
      "zh": "此外，我们将了解您在英语婚礼中可能听到的一些常见短语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 39.27,
      "end": 39.55,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 40.07,
      "end": 44.29,
      "en": "Because I think, exactly because usually it's old English.",
      "zh": "因为我想，正是因为它通常是古英语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 44.67,
      "end": 46.13,
      "en": "Maybe English that's not used anymore.",
      "zh": "也许不再使用的英语。"
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 46.44,
      "end": 47.44,
      "en": "Alright.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "start": 47.44,
      "end": 51.51,
      "en": "Well, I'm excited to find out what this unexpected event is.",
      "zh": "好吧，我很高兴知道这个意外事件是什么。"
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "start": 52.2,
      "end": 54.43,
      "en": "So let's listen to our dialogue for the first time.",
      "zh": "所以让我们第一次听我们的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "start": 65.59,
      "end": 66.39,
