      "end": 543.09,
      "en": "And we also know all of the names of the fingers.",
      "zh": "我们也知道手指的所有名称。"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 543.68,
      "end": 544.68,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 544.68,
      "end": 550.13,
      "en": "So why don't we listen to the dialogue one more time to hear these all in context.",
      "zh": "那么，我们为什么不再听一次对话，在上下文中听这些。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 552.44,
      "end": 563.48,
      "en": "The rings please.",
      "zh": "请戒指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 563.48,
      "end": 575.16,
      "en": "May this ring be blessed so he who gives it and she who wears it may abide in peace and continue in love until life's end.",
      "zh": "愿这枚戒指蒙受祝福，愿赠戒之人与佩戒之人相守相爱，平安度过一生。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 575.16,
      "end": 582.92,
      "en": "And may this ring I be wed wear it as a symbol of our love and commitment.",
      "zh": "愿我结婚的这枚戒指作为我们爱和承诺的象征。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 582.92,
      "end": 589.0,
      "en": "Honey, that's my pinky.",
      "zh": "亲爱的，那是我的小拇指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 589.0,
      "end": 592.24,
      "en": "That ring goes on the ring finger.",
      "zh": "戒指该戴在无名指上。"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 592.24,
      "end": 592.41,
      "en": "This one?",
      "zh": "这个？"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 593.56,
      "end": 595.02,
      "en": "That's my index finger.",
      "zh": "那是我的食指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 595.68,
      "end": 597.48,
      "en": "Oh, right.",
      "zh": "哦，对了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 597.48,
      "end": 597.88,
      "en": "This one, right?",
      "zh": "这个，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 598.48,
      "end": 601.48,
      "en": "That's the thumb make.",
      "zh": "那是拇指做的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 602.26,
      "end": 603.3,
      "en": "Okay, I got it.",
      "zh": "好吧，我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 603.88,
      "end": 605.28,
      "en": "This is the ring finger.",
      "zh": "这是无名指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 605.8,
      "end": 607.2,
      "en": "That's my middle finger, Nick.",
      "zh": "尼克，那是我的中指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 608.0,
      "end": 611.76,
      "en": "This is my ring finger.",
      "zh": "这是我的无名指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 611.76,
      "end": 625.12,
      "en": "All right, so now it's perfectly clear and a romantic dialogue in the end.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以现在它非常清晰，最后是一个浪漫的对话。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 625.12,
      "end": 625.71,
      "en": "Yeah, very romantic.",
      "zh": "是的，非常浪漫。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 626.33,
      "end": 627.59,
      "en": "Although a little bit embarrassing.",
      "zh": "虽然有点尴尬。"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 628.04,
      "end": 629.04,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 629.04,
      "end": 629.83,
      "en": "So what about wedding rings?",
      "zh": "那么结婚戒指呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 630.44,
      "end": 631.96,
      "en": "Now we have different types of rings, right?",
      "zh": "现在我们有不同类型的戒指，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 631.96,
      "end": 637.09,
      "en": "We have the wedding ring, the one that we just heard, but we also have an engagement ring.",
      "zh": "我们有结婚戒指，我们刚刚听到的，但我们也有一枚订婚戒指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 637.35,
      "end": 637.99,
      "en": "Yes, yeah.",
      "zh": "是的，是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 638.29,
      "end": 643.39,
      "en": "In most English speaking countries, the woman is very, very lucky because she gets two rings.",
      "zh": "在大多数英语国家，这个女人非常非常幸运，因为她得到了两个戒指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 644.4,
      "end": 649.92,
      "en": "So when the man asks her to marry him, he gives her a diamond.",
      "zh": "所以当男人要她嫁给他时，他给了她一颗钻石。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 649.92,
      "end": 650.51,
      "en": "A diamond ring.",
      "zh": "钻石戒指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 650.92,
      "end": 652.71,
      "en": "That is usually, that's the engagement ring.",
      "zh": "通常，这就是订婚戒指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 653.48,
      "end": 655.55,
      "en": "And it's really, really important that he does this.",
      "zh": "他这样做真的非常重要。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 657.04,
      "end": 660.16,
      "en": "And it's also really important that he spends a lot of money on the diamond.",
      "zh": "他在钻石上花很多钱也很重要。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 660.16,
      "end": 661.27,
      "en": "Yeah, I know about this.",
      "zh": "是的，我知道这件事。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 661.84,
      "end": 662.51,
      "en": "Diamonds are forever, right?",
      "zh": "钻石是永远的，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 662.84,
      "end": 663.84,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 663.84,
      "end": 666.81,
      "en": "And the tradition is you must spend at least one month's salary.",
      "zh": "传统是你必须至少花一个月的薪水。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 667.16,
      "end": 667.53,
      "en": "Wow.",
      "zh": "哇。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 668.16,
      "end": 669.16,
      "en": "Is that it?",
      "zh": "是吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 669.16,
      "end": 670.16,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 670.16,
      "end": 675.52,
      "en": "So the girl gets a diamond engagement ring, and then on wedding day, she gets the wedding ring.",
      "zh": "所以女孩得到了钻石订婚戒指，然后在婚礼当天，她得到了结婚戒指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 675.52,
      "end": 676.52,
      "en": "Yes.",
      "zh": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 676.52,
      "end": 677.49,
      "en": "And usually, will she wear both of them?",
      "zh": "通常，她会同时穿吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 677.72,
      "end": 678.96,
      "en": "Yeah, she'll always wear both of them.",
      "zh": "是的，她会一直穿这两个。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 679.2,
      "end": 683.2,
      "en": "So the engagement ring goes closest to you, and then the wedding ring on top.",
      "zh": "所以订婚戒指离你最近，然后是结婚戒指。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 683.6,
      "end": 685.56,
      "en": "And the engagement ring, it represents?",
      "zh": "和订婚戒指，它代表？"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 686.92,
      "end": 689.52,
      "en": "The commitment to marry her.",
      "zh": "嫁给她的承诺。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 689.52,
      "end": 692.56,
      "en": "No, wait, the commitment from the man to marry her.",
      "zh": "不，等等，男人的承诺要嫁给她。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 692.56,
      "end": 694.68,
      "en": "Okay, so it's a symbol that they will get married.",
      "zh": "好吧，所以这是他们结婚的象征。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 694.86,
      "end": 696.0,
      "en": "Yes, it's a symbol of the promise.",
      "zh": "是的，它是承诺的象征。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 696.8,
      "end": 700.38,
      "en": "Now what happens if they break up and they don't get married?",
      "zh": "现在，如果他们分手并且不结婚会怎样？"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 700.82,
      "end": 701.54,
      "en": "Does he get the ring back?",
      "zh": "他把戒指拿回来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 702.02,
      "end": 702.48,
      "en": "I don't know.",
      "zh": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 703.68,
      "end": 704.98,
      "en": "Okay, here's the rule.",
      "zh": "好吧，这是规则。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 705.99,
      "end": 709.05,
      "en": "If he was a jerk, no.",
      "zh": "如果他是个混蛋，不。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 710.64,
      "end": 713.8,
      "en": "But if it was sort of like a happy breakup, then okay.",
      "zh": "但如果这有点像一个快乐的分手，那好吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 713.8,
      "end": 714.06,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 714.38,
      "end": 715.71,
      "en": "I guess it's a big risk, right?",
      "zh": "我想这是一个很大的风险，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 716.72,
      "end": 717.72,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 717.72,
      "end": 718.72,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 718.72,
      "end": 719.24,
      "en": "That's it for today, guys.",
      "zh": "今天就是这样，伙计们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 719.72,
      "end": 721.89,
      "en": "Let us know if you guys have any interesting wedding stories.",
      "zh": "如果你们有任何有趣的婚礼故事，请告诉我们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 722.12,
      "end": 729.8,
      "en": "I know that sometimes weddings can be embarrassing, people, I don't know, objecting, maybe I've seen the groom faint.",
      "zh": "我知道有时候婚礼会很尴尬，人，我不知道，反对，也许我已经看到新郎昏倒了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 729.8,
      "end": 730.58,
      "en": "Or even fall in a pool.",
      "zh": "甚至掉进游泳池。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 730.8,
      "end": 732.32,
      "en": "Fall in a pool.",
      "zh": "落入游泳池。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 732.32,
      "end": 734.68,
      "en": "So if you have any stories, please share them with us.",
      "zh": "因此，如果您有任何故事，请与我们分享。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 735.12,
      "end": 736.56,
      "en": "Come to EnglishPod.com.",
      "zh": "来 EnglishPod.com 吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 736.56,
      "end": 740.28,
      "en": "And also if you have any questions or doubts, Erica and I are always there to answer them.",
      "zh": "而且，如果您有任何问题或疑问，Erica 和我总是在那里回答。"
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 740.72,
      "end": 742.14,
      "en": "Well thanks for listening to this lesson, everyone.",
      "zh": "谢谢大家听了这节课。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 742.62,
      "end": 743.84,
      "en": "And until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "下次再见，拜拜。"
    }
  ],
